        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laguna_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "After the dam was completed, Laguna Park quickly turned into a popular recreation spot for lake‑goers and weekend visitors.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laguna_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Small stores sprang up to serve both the surrounding farming community and the influx of Lake Whitney visitors.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laguna_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A post office was also established to keep the growing community connected to the rest of Texas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laguna_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Laguna Park’s development mirrors the broader mid‑century boom in Texas lake‑front recreation areas.",
